    <bpmn:process id="W_W4105" name="W4105. Cloud FinOps Operating Model &amp; FinOps Culture (Inform / Optimize / Operate)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; cloud/SaaS maturity
Frequency: Maintained + maturity evolution
Volume: Enterprise FinOps function (ERP core, SaaS, integration, perimeter)
Owner: FinOps Lead
Participants: CIO (VS-27), Engineering (VS-27/VS-113), Finance (VS-17.4), business owners
Source: workflow W4105 — Cloud FinOps Operating Model &amp; FinOps Culture (Inform / Optimize / Operate)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4105_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4105_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4105_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4105_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4105_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4105_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4105_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4105_Start3" name="Program stand-up; cloud/SaaS maturity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4105_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4105_Task4" name="FinOps Lead establish the FinOps operating model per the FinOps Framework…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead establish the FinOps operating model per the FinOps Framework phases: Inform (visibility/allocations W4106), Optimize (right-sizing W4107, waste W4108), Operate (anomaly W4109, governance W4112, culture)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4105_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4105_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4105_Task5" name="FinOps Lead build a cross-functional FinOps team (finance + engineering +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead build a cross-functional FinOps team (finance + engineering + business), define unit economics (cost-per-transaction/store/order), and embed cost-awareness into engineering (links to VS-113)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Engineering
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4105_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4105_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4105_Task6" name="FinOps Lead mature the practice (crawl→walk→run), benchmark, and report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps Lead mature the practice (crawl→walk→run), benchmark, and report culture/maturity to the executive team
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4105_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4105_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4105_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4105_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4105_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-636 (ensure controlled execution — Cloud FinOps, Cost Optimization &amp; Spend Governance (PA-135.2).) | - CTL-636: FinOps accountability shared (engineering + finance); unit-economics targets
Owner: FinOps Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4105_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4105_Annotation8" targetRef="W4105_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
