    <bpmn:process id="W_W4106" name="W4106. Cloud &amp; SaaS Spend Visibility, Unit Economics &amp; Forecasting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; monthly close
Frequency: Continuous + monthly
Volume: Enterprise cloud/SaaS spend (across ERP, ecommerce, marketplace, retail media, app, AI/ML, integration)
Owner: FinOps Lead / BI (VS-28)
Participants: BI (VS-28), Finance (VS-17.4), engineering, business owners
Source: workflow W4106 — Cloud &amp; SaaS Spend Visibility, Unit Economics &amp; Forecasting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4106_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4106_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4106_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4106_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4106_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4106_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4106_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4106_Start3" name="Continuous; monthly close">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4106_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4106_Task4" name="FinOps/BI ingest all cloud/SaaS billing and allocation tags, map spend to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps/BI ingest all cloud/SaaS billing and allocation tags, map spend to business units/capabilities/products (TBM W4097), and compute unit economics (cost-per-transaction, cost-per-order, cost-per-store)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / BI
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4106_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4106_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4106_Task5" name="FinOps/Finance forecast cloud/SaaS spend (usage trends, seasonality, growth)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps/Finance forecast cloud/SaaS spend (usage trends, seasonality, growth), reconcile to budget (W4098) and actuals (W4117), and surface variance
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4106_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4106_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4106_Task6" name="FinOps publish dashboards to engineering/business, drive accountability, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps publish dashboards to engineering/business, drive accountability, and feed optimization (W4107/W4108)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / BI
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4106_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4106_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4106_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4106_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4106_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-636 (ensure controlled execution — Cloud FinOps, Cost Optimization &amp; Spend Governance (PA-135.2).) | - CTL-636: tagging policy enforced; spend reconciled to GL monthly
Owner: FinOps Lead / BI (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4106_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4106_Annotation8" targetRef="W4106_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
