    <bpmn:process id="W_W4107" name="W4107. Cloud Resource Rightsizing, Reservation &amp; Commitment Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Usage data; reservation/commitment cycle
Frequency: Continuous + commitment cycle
Volume: Enterprise cloud resource estate
Owner: FinOps Lead / Cloud Engineering
Participants: Engineering (VS-27/VS-113), Finance (VS-17.4), business owners
Source: workflow W4107 — Cloud Resource Rightsizing, Reservation &amp; Commitment Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4107_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4107_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4107_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4107_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4107_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4107_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4107_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4107_Start3" name="Usage data; reservation/commitment cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4107_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4107_Task4" name="FinOps/engineering analyze usage vs provisioned capacity, identify rightsizing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps/engineering analyze usage vs provisioned capacity, identify rightsizing opportunities (over-provisioned compute/storage/services), and resize
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Engineering
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4107_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4107_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4107_Task5" name="FinOps/Finance optimize commitments (reserved instances, savings plans…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps/Finance optimize commitments (reserved instances, savings plans, committed-use discounts) against steady-state baseload, balancing commitment vs flexibility/risk
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / CIO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4107_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4107_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4107_Task6" name="FinOps track realized savings (W4113), monitor utilization of commitments, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps track realized savings (W4113), monitor utilization of commitments, and adjust on cadence
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4107_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4107_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4107_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4107_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
