        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-636 (ensure controlled execution — Cloud FinOps, Cost Optimization &amp; Spend Governance (PA-135.2).) | - CTL-636: commitment decisions with risk/Finance review; performance guardrails on rightsizing
Owner: FinOps Lead / Cloud Engineering</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
