    <bpmn:process id="W_W4108" name="W4108. Waste Elimination, Idle Resource &amp; Storage Cost Reduction" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Waste scan; cost optimization cycle
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Enterprise cloud/SaaS estate
Owner: FinOps Lead / Cloud Engineering
Participants: Engineering (VS-27), ITAM (VS-99), data engineering (VS-28.2)
Source: workflow W4108 — Waste Elimination, Idle Resource &amp; Storage Cost Reduction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4108_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4108_Lane1" name="FinOps Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4108_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4108_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4108_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4108_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4108_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4108_Start3" name="Waste scan; cost optimization cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4108_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4108_Task4" name="FinOps/engineering identify waste: idle/under-used compute, orphaned resources…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps/engineering identify waste: idle/under-used compute, orphaned resources, over-retained storage/snapshots/log data, redundant services, dev/test left running
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Engineering
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4108_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4108_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4108_Task5" name="FinOps/engineering eliminate (auto-schedule off-hours, archive to cheaper…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps/engineering eliminate (auto-schedule off-hours, archive to cheaper tiers, delete orphaned, lifecycle policies for 7-yr retention links to VS-88), and validate no business impact
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Engineering / ITAM
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4108_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4108_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4108_Task6" name="FinOps track savings (W4113), embed waste-prevention in engineering practice…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps track savings (W4113), embed waste-prevention in engineering practice (guardrails/policy-as-code), and report
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4108_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4108_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4108_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4108_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4108_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-636 (ensure controlled execution — Cloud FinOps, Cost Optimization &amp; Spend Governance (PA-135.2).) | - CTL-636: data retention compliance (VS-88/VS-91) before deletion; change management on elimination
Owner: FinOps Lead / Cloud Engineering</bpmn:text>
