      <bpmn:userTask id="W4112_Task4" name="IT/Finance discover shadow IT (unsanctioned SaaS/apps paid via expense links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/Finance discover shadow IT (unsanctioned SaaS/apps paid via expense links to VS-34, network/cloud discovery, SSO log analysis), and assess risk (data privacy links to VS-91, security links to VS-27.3, duplication)
Responsible (R): IT / Security / FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CIO / IT Security Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4112_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4112_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
