        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/business decide: sanction/adopt, migrate to standard, or retire; route demand through intake (W4101); address the underlying un-met need
Responsible (R): IT / Business Units / Procurement
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per discovery</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4112_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4112_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4112_Task6" name="IT/Finance establish governance (policy, expense controls, SSO/procurement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT/Finance establish governance (policy, expense controls, SSO/procurement gates), monitor, and report shadow-IT reduction
Responsible (R): IT / FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4112_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4112_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
